OL,3,GNEWSAOut-of-contract e-bike firm
OL,4,Arefuses to quit Ealing
OL,5,
OL,6,FE-bike rental company Voi has vowed to
OL,7,Fcontinue operating in a west London
OL,8,Fborough, despite losing out on a local
OL,9,Fauthority contract to rival providers.
OL,11,FVoi began a dockless e-bike trial in
OL,12,FEaling in May 2025, operating alongside
OL,13,FLime. But earlier this year, Ealing
OL,14,FCouncil awarded new contracts to Lime
OL,15,Fand Forest, expecting Voi to leave the
OL,16,Fborough.
OL,18,FVoi argued it had performed well in the
OL,19,Fborough and there were no legal grounds
OL,20,Fto exclude it.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
